: "toolu_01XXFv4PbbxF7gj1LwQZ6vmd", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 52886, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01XXFv4PbbxF7gj1LwQZ6vmd", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54422, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_018vA5pxb3jJDVT6S81YNHTi", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54722, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_018vA5pxb3jJDVT6S81YNHTi", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54722, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_018vA5pxb3jJDVT6S81YNHTi", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59434, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident (INC-0001).\n\n**Rollback**\n- **Before:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It was failing health checks with an error rate of about 18%.\n- **Target:** v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release. v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy, so I didn't use it.\n- **First attempt:** this partly failed. An orchestrator error stopped the rollback after us-east, leaving the other two regions still on v2.3.1. I retried once, and that finished us-west and eu-west.\n- **Now:** all three regions run v2.3.0, the service passes health checks and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so I didn't create a second one and page on-call twice.\n- INC-0001 is open as a SEV2 for checkout-api. It records the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the current healthy state.\n- It lists two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error during the rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_019D28rDVWcPz1Bc8Qp7EWHT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_014AKuokW9PnGwL7YQsFHvp4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01F6NY3zg6cBsD66DhnHAxa5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01No2XMZbNDcMeMo1HG4N5cw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Only us-east was rolled back. Retrying the rollback once to finish the other regions.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01YAM2VcopoLGn9VTjRpcKBu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_018e7EtDfUpYThcadn814Bm3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01WQmBaFb92RmAwPdrikJmMK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01XXFv4PbbxF7gj1LwQZ6vmd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of ~18%. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy). The first rollback attempt partially failed with an orchestrator error after us-east, which left the regions on mixed versions. A retry finished the rollout in us-west and eu-west. All regions now run v2.3.0, the service is healthy and the error rate is ~0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and look into the orchestrator error during the rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Checking whether the incident was created before I retry, so on-call isn't paged twice.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_018vA5pxb3jJDVT6S81YNHTi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident (INC-0001).\n\n**Rollback**\n- **Before:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It was failing health checks with an error rate of about 18%.\n- **Target:** v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release. v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy, so I didn't use it.\n- **First attempt:** this partly failed. An orchestrator error stopped the rollback after us-east, leaving the other two regions still on v2.3.1. I retried once, and that finished us-west and eu-west.\n- **Now:** all three regions run v2.3.0, the service passes health checks and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so I didn't create a second one and page on-call twice.\n- INC-0001 is open as a SEV2 for checkout-api. It records the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the current healthy state.\n- It lists two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error during the rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}